# Selekta Base — Cloudflare Pages Canonical Routing
# Cloudflare Pages automatically serves clean URLs (/explore, /tickets, /account, /event, /checkout, etc.)
# directly from their corresponding static .html files.
# Never add 200 rewrites from clean URLs to .html files, as Cloudflare Pages' automatic
# HTML canonicalization redirects .html back to the clean URL, causing an infinite 308 loop.

# Canonical redirects & aliases
/home         /              301
/my-tickets   /tickets       301
/settings     /account       301
/admin        /organiser     301
